    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ocean Otter Climb</strong> is a 2D platformer game about climbing to great heights. <br>An otter has fallen into the deep sea, where someone has drained all the water! <br>Now, the otter must make its way back to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump from platform to platform and escape the depths of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can soak in water to fill your water pouch! <br>Use the water as a booster to reach higher and farther platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the otter safely return to the surface? <br>Start your challenge now!</p>",
